{"id":"n64597-1-17","stage":0,"title":"수업 · 授课","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64597-1-17-1","ko":"우리 오늘 학교 끝나고 운동장에서 놀자.","zh":"我们今天放学后去操场玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동장에서","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀자.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]}